          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 5: Folio 4r, left side",
          "value": "\n<ol dir=\"ltr\"><li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">su\u0304reyi ma\u02bfen terk</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>eyleyu\u0308b, iki a\u0304h\u032eir</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>rek\u02bfat\u0131nda Fa\u0304tih\u0323ay\u0131 ve su\u0304reyi</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>k\u0323az\u0307a\u0304 itse, yine</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>sehv-i secde ide.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Herk\u0323ang\u0307\u0131 nama\u0304z olursa,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>iki evvelki rek\u02bfat\u0131nda</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
