      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 5: Folio 4r, left side",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>the chapter,</li>\n<li>then in the last two</li>\n<li>rak\u02bfas, you say the Fa\u0304tih\u0323a and the chapter,</li>\n<li>again,</li>\n<li>your prayer is invalid.</li>\n<li>Whateer obligatory prayer it is,</li>\n<li>if in&nbsp;the first two rak\u02bfas</li></ol>\n",
