      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 12: Folio 4r, right side",
          "value": "\n<ol dir=\"ltr\"><li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Bes\u0327inci ni\u02bfmet-i I\u0307sla\u0304m&rsquo;a</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>s\u0327u\u0308kri terk etmek.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Alt\u0131nc\u0131 i\u0304ma\u0304ns\u0131z gitmeden</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>k\u0323ork\u0323mamak\u0323. Yedinci na\u0304-h\u0323ak\u0323k\u0323</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>yere z\u0323ulu\u0308m etmek.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Sekizinci su\u0308nnet u\u0308zere</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>ok\u0323unan eza\u0304na ica\u0304bet</p>\n</li>\n<li>etmemek (bottom left)</li></ol>\n",
